# Benchmark arm jars: 23 shaded jars, ~1.3 GB, and rebuildable. Each one embeds a
# benchmark-provenance.properties (phase + commit) that every run manifest records, so a result stays
# traceable to the code that produced it via scripts/build-jar.sh without the binary in git.
pipeline_benchmark2/jars/
